· Collection efficiency for 1.5 μm particles: 96.5% ± 1.2%
· Deutsch-Anderson prediction with Cunningham slip correction: 98.2%
· Discrepancy attributed to triboelectric charge variation on perchlorate-containing particles
· Ozone generation: <0.5 ppm at 5 kV, below the SMAC limit of 0.1 ppm for continuous exposure

Full-Scale Design Specification. Based on the validated performance, the ESP stage for a four-crew module is specified as follows:

Parameter Value
