· PPC (Post-Plasma Catalysis): Bare dielectric DBD reactor (same dimensions) followed by a packed bed of La₁.₇Cs₀.₃CoMnO₆₋δ pellets (5 mm diameter, 30 mm bed length) located 50 mm downstream of the discharge zone.

Simulations were performed for the Mars habitat mixture (95% CO₂, 3% O₂, 2% H₂O, 600 Pa) at a specific input energy (SIE) of 400 J/L. The results are summarized in Table 6.1.

